  vendorName: Surgeon Blackwood
  offerText: That wound on your arm looks dreadfully infected. Hand over your life
    savings now, and I will stitch it up before it spreads to your heart.
  acceptResultText: You hand over the heavy fee. The surgeon works quickly and brutally,
    but the terrible pain fades. He saved your life.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the greedy doctor. Within minutes, the infection rapidly
    spreads, causing you agonizing pain and a terrifying, blinding fever.
